  "code": "struct GraphTexel { float3 color; float alpha; };\nGraphTexel sampleColor(Texture2D<float4> image, SamplerState nearest, float2 uv)\n{\n    float4 sample = image.SampleLevel(nearest, uv, 0);\n    GraphTexel result;\n    result.color = sample.rgb;\n    result.alpha = sample.a;\n    return result;\n}\nfloat4 scaleColor(float3 sample, float4 tint, float gain, float alpha)\n{\n    return float4(sample * tint.rgb * gain, alpha * tint.a);\n}\n",
